# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the onnx soak.
#
# onnxruntime allocates process-wide state and thread pools that live until
# exit (still-reachable, not lost) and are built without instrumentation, so
# LSan cannot always see they are reachable. These suppressions scope the
# leak check to sqlite-predict's own allocations; a real leak in
# predict-onnx.c has no libonnxruntime frame and is still reported.
leak:libonnxruntime
leak:onnxruntime::
